# The study round that study.py / study_driver.sbatch work on (KEY=VALUE; variables set in the environment win).
# study_driver.sbatch sources this file in bash, so values with spaces or brackets must be quoted.
# Round 3 (decision 2026-10-21, notes/analysis-plan.md section 11): the whole cohort of round 2 again on the fixed
# pipeline (kernel with the resource venv active, disk checks, exact notebook paths), and the Zenodo reserve
# extended along the same seed sequence (analysis/sampling/extend_zenodo_reserve.py) until 400 are analysable.
# The draw folder was prepared on the workstation; sync_from_repo.sh ships it as data/draw-2026-10-09-r3 and
# study.py copies it once to NBF_DRAW_DIR. Rounds 1 and 2 stay untouched in results/study/ and results/study-r2/.
NBF_STUDY=study-r3
NBF_DRAW_DIR=data/sampling/draw/2026-10-09-r3
NBF_DRAW_FROM=data/draw-2026-10-09-r3
NBF_FIRST_COHORT=cohort-all.csv
NBF_RERUN_REASON="round 2 ran notebooks without the resource venv active, lost 8 resources to full node disks and path bugs, and stopped Zenodo at 355 of 400 analysable; whole cohort again on the fixed pipeline, Zenodo reserve extended along the same seed sequence"
